WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.325 --> 00:00:01.330
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:01.994 --> 00:00:04.375
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can you <b>play</b> a <b>musical instrument</b>?

3
00:00:04.654 --> 00:00:05.983
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, I <b>can</b>.

4
00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:07.653
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What</b> can you <b>play</b>?

5
00:00:08.024 --> 00:00:09.725
<v><b>B:</b></v> I can <b>play</b> the <b>guitar</b>.

6
00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:12.276
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

7
00:00:12.925 --> 00:00:14.317
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Where</b> can I <b>sit</b>?

8
00:00:14.564 --> 00:00:16.172
<v><b>B:</b></v> You can <b>sit over there</b>.

9
00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.816
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

10
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.841
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can I <b>park here</b>?

11
00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:23.609
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No</b>, you <b>can’t</b>. You <b>can’t park here</b>.